    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "payload_schema_unicode": {
  "description": "Unicode string length for minLength (ADR-0024, GR-5). Same shape as payload_schema: validate each case's `data` against `schema`; every SDK's payload validator MUST agree on `valid`. Length is the number of Unicode CODE POINTS — not UTF-8 bytes, not UTF-16 code units, not grapheme clusters. maxLength is intentionally absent: no SDK supports it yet (arrives with K-17 in R1).",
